+# Version Scheme
+
+This project uses Semantic Versioning (major.minor.patch) for release versioning. The scheme was chosen because API compatibility matters more than signaling publication dates: a major increment signals breaking changes, a minor increment signals backward-compatible additions, and a patch increment signals bug fixes, so API consumers can tell from the version number whether compatibility is maintained or broken.
